{
  "sn11.5:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 11.5 ",
  "sn11.5:0.2": "1. Paṭhamavagga ",
  "sn11.5:0.3": "Subhāsitajayasutta ",
  "sn11.5:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn11.5:1.2": "“Bhūtapubbaṁ, bhikkhave, devāsurasaṅgāmo samupabyūḷho ahosi. ",
  "sn11.5:1.3": "Atha kho, bhikkhave, vepacitti asurindo sakkaṁ devānamindaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn11.5:1.4": "‘hotu, devānaminda, subhāsitena jayo’ti. ",
  "sn11.5:1.5": "‘Hotu, vepacitti, subhāsitena jayo’ti. ",
  "sn11.5:1.6": "Atha kho, bhikkhave, devā ca asurā ca pārisajje ṭhapesuṁ: ",
  "sn11.5:1.7": "‘ime no subhāsitadubbhāsitaṁ ājānissantī’ti. ",
  "sn11.5:1.8": "Atha kho, bhikkhave, vepacitti asurindo sakkaṁ devānamindaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn11.5:1.9": "‘bhaṇa, devānaminda, gāthan’ti. ",
  "sn11.5:1.10": "Evaṁ vutte, bhikkhave, sakko devānamindo vepacittiṁ asurindaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn11.5:1.11": "‘tumhe khvettha, vepacitti, pubbadevā. ",
  "sn11.5:1.12": "Bhaṇa, vepacitti, gāthan’ti. ",
  "sn11.5:1.13": "Evaṁ vutte, bhikkhave, vepacitti asurindo imaṁ gāthaṁ abhāsi: ",
  "sn11.5:2.1": "‘Bhiyyo bālā pabhijjeyyuṁ, ",
  "sn11.5:2.2": "no cassa paṭisedhako; ",
  "sn11.5:2.3": "Tasmā bhusena daṇḍena, ",
  "sn11.5:2.4": "dhīro bālaṁ nisedhaye’ti. ",
  "sn11.5:3.1": "Bhāsitāya kho pana, bhikkhave, vepacittinā asurindena gāthāya asurā anumodiṁsu, devā tuṇhī ahesuṁ. ",
  "sn11.5:3.2": "Atha kho, bhikkhave, vepacitti asurindo sakkaṁ devānamindaṁ etadavoca: "